{"key":"work/1850s","entities":[{"id":"work.tianchao-tianmu","type":"work","labels":{"zh-Hans":"《天朝田亩制度》"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1853","end":"1853","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"天京"},"coord":[118.78,32.06]}]},"medium":"essay","summary":{"zh-Hans":"太平天国定都天京后颁布，主张按人口平分土地、取消私有，建立「无处不均匀」的理想秩序。它反映了农民对土地的诉求，但因绝对平均而难以实行。"},"tags":["文献","教材"],"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"}]},{"id":"work.zizheng-xinpian","type":"work","labels":{"zh-Hans":"《资政新篇》"},"time":{"kind":"interval","start":"1859","end":"1859","precision":"year"},"space":{"points":[{"name":{"zh-Hans":"天京"},"coord":[118.78,32.06]}]},"medium":"essay","summary":{"zh-Hans":"洪仁玕提出的改革方案，主张仿效西方办工厂、修铁路、设银行、开报馆。它是近代中国最早的系统性近代化构想之一，但未及推行。"},"tags":["文献","教材"],"sources":[{"ref":"source.textbook-8a"}]}]}